Package: fireball-browser
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Fireball Project <info@fireball.dev>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.64), libnss3 (>= 3.53)
Description: Fireball Browser - Modern, Private & Secure Multi-Tier Web Browser
 Fireball is a next-generation web browser combining hardened Chromium
 engine security, native Rust adblock filtering, and multi-space tabs.
